-- Reservation — a capacity hold on an inventory by a profile,
-- optionally tied to an entitlement. Three EntityRef fields
-- (inventoryId, profileId; entitlementId wrapped in Maybe) plus two
-- timestamp fields (one bare Date, one Maybe Date).
--
-- Static rows: none. Identity (label / description / icon) is
-- registered by defineSystemEntity on the TS side.
--
-- Phase 3d of the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3d-system-entities-wholesale-flip.md.
-- Three "drop the Id suffix" overrides (inventoryId → "Inventory",
-- profileId → "Profile", entitlementId → "Entitlement"). The two
-- timestamp fields humanize cleanly to "Reserved At" / "Released At".

@entity
@codeName "reservation"
@label "Reservation"
@description "A capacity hold on an inventory by a profile, optionally tied to an entitlement"
@icon "bookmark"
@fieldLabel "inventoryId" "Inventory"
@fieldLabel "profileId" "Profile"
@fieldLabel "entitlementId" "Entitlement"
Reservation = Reservation inventoryId: EntityRef<"inventory"> profileId: EntityRef<"profile"> entitlementId: Maybe (EntityRef<"entitlement">) reservedAt: Date releasedAt: Maybe Date
